# mcp__rea_binary_session — rea/binary_session

Report the complete current target, provider, capability availability, client-feature, analysis, and server-identity status without starting analysis.

## Schema
```ts
type Args = {
  /** Expected package version used to reject stale or mismatched input. */
  expected_package_version?: string;
  /** Expected catalog digest used to reject stale or mismatched input. */
  expected_catalog_digest?: string;
  /** Absolute local filesystem path expected for the running server; relative paths are rejected. */
  expected_server_path?: string;
};
```
Execute by writing JSON to xd://mcp__rea_binary_session.

